  "details": "Description\n\nIf I manually change networks locally, it will cause network issues and then reconnect to the current world.\n\nBut when I rejoin, other players will see two of me — one is the me who joined after reconnecting, and the other is the me from when I disconnected.\n\nIt seems that when I disconnect, my old Avatar is not removed from other people's clients?\n\nI set Frequency to Always because its easy to reproduce, i can even duplicate many times of myself\n\nReproduction Steps\n\nsee description\n\nDetails\n\n- Category: Networking\n\n- Frequency: Always\n\n---\n\nplatform: PC (platform: Windows, store: Steam, headset: None)\n\nrawPlatform: WindowsPlayer\n\nclientVersion: 2026.3.2-1896-3369f677b3-Release\n\nunityVersion: 6000.0.60f1-DWR\n\nIn-Client Report\n\n---\n\n**Log file:** [output_log_2026-08-19_19-28-42.txt](https://api.vrchat.cloud/api/1/file/file_3e2f6c9d-60da-44a1-9950-c67a3d9a1552/1/file)",
